      "html": "<div class=\"oath roadmap\">\n  <div class=\"oath-frame oath-frame-wide\">\n    <div class=\"relic-head\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"oath-kicker\">THE WANDERING SQUIRE · 2030<\/div>\n        <h1>\n          <span class=\"oath-cap\">T<\/span>\n          he Long Road\n        <\/h1>\n      <\/div>\n      <div class=\"relic-intro\">Two roads, one tournament in autumn.<\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"road-scroll\">\n      <div class=\"road-grid\">\n        <div class=\"road-month road-corner\"><\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 2;\">JAN<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 3;\">FEB<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 4;\">MAR<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 5;\">APR<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 6;\">MAY<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 7;\">JUN<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 8;\">JUL<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 9;\">AUG<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 10;\">SEP<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 11;\">OCT<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 12;\">NOV<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-month\" style=\"grid-column: 13;\">DEC<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-lane\" style=\"grid-row: 2; color: #4B2A6B;\">Judo · main<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-lane\" style=\"grid-row: 3; color: #5E3550;\">Bodyweight<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-lane\" style=\"grid-row: 4; color: #7A4A22;\">Riding<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-phase road-dark road-current\" style=\"grid-column: 2 / span 8; grid-row: 2;\" title=\"1 Jan 2030 to 31 Aug 2030 (current)\">Two sessions a week<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-phase road-ink road-ahead\" style=\"grid-column: 10 / span 2; grid-row: 2;\" title=\"1 Sep 2030 to 31 Oct 2030 (ahead)\">Tournament<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-phase road-lilac road-current\" style=\"grid-column: 2 / span 5; grid-row: 3;\" title=\"1 Jan 2030 to 31 May 2030 (current)\">Cut, 0.4 kg/wk to <b>78 kg<\/b><\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-phase road-pale road-ahead\" style=\"grid-column: 7 / span 7; grid-row: 3;\" title=\"1 Jun 2030 to 31 Dec 2030 (ahead)\">Hold<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-phase road-ride road-current\" style=\"grid-column: 3 / span 2; grid-row: 4;\" title=\"1 Feb 2030 to 31 Mar 2030 (current)\">Base<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-phase road-accent road-ahead\" style=\"grid-column: 5 / span 1; grid-row: 4;\" title=\"1 Apr 2030 to 30 Apr 2030 (ahead)\">100 km / 800 m<\/div>\n        <div class=\"road-today\" style=\"left: calc(var(--road-label) + 6px + (100% - var(--road-label) - 6px) * 0.1068);\">\n          <span>Today · 9 Feb 2030<\/span>\n        <\/div>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"road-gates\">\n      <b>Gates: <\/b>\n      <span class=\"road-gate road-gate-done\">☑ 78 kg (27 Jan 2030)<\/span>\n      <span class=\"road-gate \">☐ The long ride (Jun)<\/span>\n      <span class=\"road-gate \">☐ Example Hill (May)<\/span>\n    <\/div>\n    <div class=\"oath-footer\">\n      <div class=\"oath-footer-left\">Past phases are dimmed; the current one is outlined.<\/div>\n      <div class=\"oath-footer-right relic-motto\">Every hill is a lesson.<\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>",
